  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A point object is moving with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> in front of an arrangement of two mirrors as shown in the figure. The magnitude of velocity of the image in mirror <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> with respect to the image in mirror <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is</p>\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0082_eb1154615e04.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 105px;\" />"
  },
